{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48889","headline":"罗敷东馆亭下流泉云至前山拥咽经岁移时掬弄惆怅成章 · 李郢","name":"罗敷东馆亭下流泉云至前山拥咽经岁移时掬弄惆怅成章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"看山亭下小鸣泉，呜咽难通亦可怜。\n惆怅无人爲疎凿，拥愁含恨过年年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}